                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "llville: Return instructions. Act 1 - horror quest with an excellent atmosphere.\n\nLike any game of this genre, first of all it is research, searching for items and solving puzzles. Highlights its good storyline, thoughtful dialogues and excellent gloomy atmosphere, the atmosphere of despair. It is very convenient that in the game the cursor changes color in places of interaction and on objects that can be inspected or picked up, this really makes the task easier, because the locations are extensive, and to reconsider everything, it would be problematic.\n\nAccording to the plot, you, due to the circumstances of the fate, found yourself in a frightening town, from which you now have to find your way home. And it will not be easy. The oppressive atmosphere excites and at the same time makes you enjoy it, you do not know whom to trust, everyone can be a villain.\n\nAn excellent quest, which can not be called easy and having its own unique dark atmosphere.",
